    {
      "key": "t7a50622ba81d506f",
      "english": "How Liquidity Affects Stock CFDs",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-stock-trading-in-uae-accessing-global-equity-markets-through-digital-platforms#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-stock-trading-in-uae-accessing-global-equity-markets-through-digital-platforms"
      ],
      "translation": "流动性如何影响股票差价合约"
    },
    {
      "key": "td94931840b7777fe",
      "english": "Liquidity is how easily you can buy or sell a stock. In a liquid market, your trade doesn’t push the price much. Popular shares have many buyers and sellers around the world. That usually means steadier prices and smoother trades.",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-stock-trading-in-uae-accessing-global-equity-markets-through-digital-platforms#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-stock-trading-in-uae-accessing-global-equity-markets-through-digital-platforms"
      ],
      "translation": "流动性是指您购买或出售股票的容易程度。在流动性市场中，您的交易不会大幅推高价格。热门股票在世界各地有许多买家和卖家。这通常意味着更稳定的价格和更顺畅的交易。"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc5293922b5999f60",
      "english": "A good platform links to large global sources of liquidity. This keeps its prices close to the real market all day.",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-stock-trading-in-uae-accessing-global-equity-markets-through-digital-platforms#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-stock-trading-in-uae-accessing-global-equity-markets-through-digital-platforms"
      ],
      "translation": "一个好的平台可以连接到全球大量的流动性来源。这使其价格全天接近真实市场。"
    },
    {
      "key": "t625c18885592a6d4",
      "english": "Share prices react to a steady stream of news. This includes:",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
