      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">问题2. 流动性为何重要?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t305074edecc1f383",
      "english": "Earnings news, mergers and sector updates can move a share price. CFD prices change almost at once through live data.",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-stock-trading-in-uae-accessing-global-equity-markets-through-digital-platforms#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-stock-trading-in-uae-accessing-global-equity-markets-through-digital-platforms"
      ],
      "translation": "盈利消息、合并和行业更新可能会影响股价。差价合约价格通过实时数据几乎立即发生变化。"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbb81ec1d482a8c1b",
      "english": "Platforms show live buy and sell prices and contract details. Prices update all the time. This keeps CFD prices in line with the real market.",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-stock-trading-in-uae-accessing-global-equity-markets-through-digital-platforms#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-stock-trading-in-uae-accessing-global-equity-markets-through-digital-platforms"
      ],
      "translation": "平台显示实时买卖价格和合同详细信息。价格随时更新。这使差价合约价格与实际市场保持一致。"
    },
    {
